cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Experimented On Without Consent: disclosure audit of DSA-designated platforms"
abstract: >-
  Replication materials for a census-based disclosure audit of the 26 services
  designated by the European Commission as Very Large Online Platforms or Very
  Large Online Search Engines under the Digital Services Act, examining what
  those services disclose to users about behavioural experimentation and in
  which documentary register that disclosure appears.
